{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"enum","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"RandomizedSVD","kind":"identifier"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"anchor":"overview","text":"Overview","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Computes an approximate rank-k SVD of an M×N matrix A:"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"A ≈ U * diag(S) * Vᵀ"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"where U is M×k orthonormal, S is k-vector of singular values, Vᵀ is k×N."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Complexity","text":"Complexity","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"O(M·N·k) — dramatically faster than full "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"dgesdd_"},{"type":"text","text":" O(M·N²) when k ≪ min(M, N)."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Algorithm-Halko-2011","text":"Algorithm (Halko 2011)","type":"heading","level":2},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Draw random Gaussian matrix Ω ∈ ℝ^{N×(k+p)}  (p=10 oversampling).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute range sketch Y = A·Ω  via BLAS dgemm.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Orthonormalize Y via thin QR (dgeqrf + dorgqr).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Project B = Qᵀ·A  (small k×N matrix).","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Compute small exact SVD of B with dgesdd_.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Back-project left singular vectors: U = Q·Ũ.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"anchor":"Reference","text":"Reference","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Halko N., Martinsson P.G., Tropp J.A. (2011). Finding Structure with Randomness:"},{"type":"text","text